    schema:description "Extends 3' ends of gene annotations using BAM files (from STAR alignments) and a reference GTF. Specifically designed for 3'-biased sequencing techniques like 10X scRNA-seq or BRB-seq that primarily capture transcript 3' ends. The BREW3R tool enhances annotations by using evidence from RNA-seq data to improve 3' UTR definitions, which is particularly important for accurate quantification in single-cell and bulk RNA-seq experiments." ;
