```
Then, you can run the parser in the terminal, changing `PATH-TO-FOLDER` to the specific folder the parser is in, unless the terminal is run in the folder itself.
```bash
python PATH-TO-FOLDER/UC7-ETL.py
```
Once it is finished, you will have all of the parsed JSON files in the [OUTPUT](https://github.com/EGA-archive/EuCanImage-FHIR/tree/main/UC7_Breast_Cancer_MRI/OUTPUT) folder
