    schema:dateCreated "2025-02-18T20:38:43Z" ;
    schema:dateModified "2025-02-18T20:38:43Z" ;
    schema:description """Workflow to download and prepare TCGA data.

The workflow divides the process of generating Gene Regulatory networks from TCGA cancer data in three steps:

1. Downloading the raw data from GDC and saving the rds/tables needed later
2. Preparing the data. This step includes filtering the data, normalizing it...
3. Analysis of gene regulatory networks""" ;
    schema:keywords "Bioinformatics, GRN, cancer" ;
    schema:license "https://spdx.org/licenses/GPL-3.0" ;
    schema:name "tcga-data-nf" ;
    schema:producer <https://workflowhub.eu/projects/308> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage <https://workflowhub.eu/workflows/1306#nextflow> ;
    schema:sdPublisher <https://about.workflowhub.eu/> ;
