    schema:description """This workflow query metagenomic raw data against a metaplasmidome database to identify plasmids and annotate them with genes, KO, PFAM

## Associated Tutorial

This workflows is part of the tutorial [Query an annotated mobile genetic element database to identify and annotate genetic elements (e.g. plasmids) in metagenomics data](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/topics/microbiome/tutorials/metaplasmidome_query/tutorial.html), available in the [GTN](https://training.galaxyproject.org)

## Features

* Includes [Galaxy Workflow Tests](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/faqs/gtn/workflow_run_test.html)
* Includes a [Galaxy Workflow Report](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/faqs/galaxy/workflows_report_view.html)

## Thanks to...

**Workflow Author(s)**: Bérénice Batut, Nadia Goué

**Tutorial Author(s)**: [Bérénice Batut](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/hall-of-fame/bebatut/), [Nadia Goué](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/hall-of-fame/nagoue/), [Didier Debroas](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/hall-of-fame/debroas/)

