**Funder(s)**: [Deutsche Forschungsgemeinschaft](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/hall-of-fame/dfg/)

**Grants(s)**: [NFDI4Bioimage](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/hall-of-fame/nfdi4bioimage/)

[![gtn star logo followed by the word workflows](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/assets/branding/gtn-workflows.png)](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/)""" ;
