    schema:description """CLIP-Seq data analysis from pre-processing to motif detection

## Associated Tutorial

This workflows is part of the tutorial [CLIP-Seq data analysis from pre-processing to motif detection](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/topics/transcriptomics/tutorials/clipseq/tutorial.html), available in the [GTN](https://training.galaxyproject.org)





