        <https://workflowhub.eu/workflows/1738#This%20study%20was%20founded%20by%20the%20French%20National%20Research%20Agency%20and%20by%20Sant%C3%A9%20publique%20France%20as%20part%20of%20the%20project%20%22EMERGEN%22.%20Anses%20Ploufragan%20research%20was%20also%20supported%20by%20Agglom%C3%A9ration%20de%20Saint-Brieuc> ;
