    schema:description "The workflow main goal is to quality trim reads of input fastq files and to remove adaptors. It can also run Biobloom tools and species detector in order to check for contamination. Finally it runs fastq QC to obtain quality check after trimming. The workflow was designed to be run in the SeqUIa (http://cfb.ceitec.muni.cz/sequia) application." ;
