    schema:description "The ProteomIQon is a collection of open source computational proteomics tools to build pipelines for the evaluation of MS derived proteomics data written in F#. The current state of the tool chain allows handle tasks like signal detection, peptide identification, quantification and protein inference. Each ProteomIQon tool is concerned with a specific task. This makes the tool-chain flexibel and easily extendable." ;
