    schema:description """This workflow performs taxonomic classification of an input sequence collection (e.g., bins from SemiBin2 or MetaBat) using GTDB-Tk and kMetaShot (optional). GTDB-Tk taxonomy is mapped to NCBI taxIDs and names to reconcile differences between NCBI/GTDB taxonomies.
""" ;
