    schema:description """Train and evaluate a HANCOCK recurrence model with Multimodal Learner

## Associated Tutorial

This workflows is part of the tutorial [Gleam Multimodal Learner - Head and Neck cancer Recurrence Prediction with HANCOCK](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/topics/statistics/tutorials/multimodal_learner/tutorial.html), available in the [GTN](https://training.galaxyproject.org)

## Features

* Includes [Galaxy Workflow Tests](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/faqs/gtn/workflow_run_test.html)
* Includes a [Galaxy Workflow Report](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/faqs/galaxy/workflows_report_view.html)

## Thanks to...

**Workflow Author(s)**: Paulo Cilas Morais Lyra Junior, Junhao Qiu, Khai Dang, Alyssa Pybus, Jeremy Goecks

**Tutorial Author(s)**: [Paulo Cilas Morais Lyra Junior](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/hall-of-fame/paulocilasjr/), [Khai Van Dang](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/hall-of-fame/khaivandangusf2210/), [Alyssa Pybus](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/hall-of-fame/afpybus/), [Junhao Qiu](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/hall-of-fame/qchiujunhao/), [Jeremy Goecks](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/hall-of-fame/jgoecks/)

[![gtn star logo followed by the word workflows](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/assets/branding/gtn-workflows.png)](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/)""" ;
