    ns1:input <https://workflowhub.eu/workflows/252#pangeo_101_for_everyone___introduction_to_xarray-inputs-0_Input%20Parameter>,
        <https://workflowhub.eu/workflows/252#pangeo_101_for_everyone___introduction_to_xarray-inputs-10_Input%20Parameter>,
