        <https://workflowhub.eu/workflows/252#pangeo_101_for_everyone___introduction_to_xarray-inputs-5_Input%20Parameter>,
        <https://workflowhub.eu/workflows/252#pangeo_101_for_everyone___introduction_to_xarray-inputs-6_Input%20Parameter>,
