    schema:description "Comprehensive Hi-C data processing workflow that converts paired-end FASTQ files to balanced contact matrices. Uses HiCUP for pre-processing (adapter trimming, mapping, filtering) with fragment midpoint coordinate assignment, filters reads by mapping quality, and generates sorted tabix files. The final output is a balanced cool file at user-specified resolution created with cooler, ready for multi-resolution contact matrix analysis." ;
