    schema:description """The containerised pipeline for profiling shotgun metagenomic data is derived from the [MGnify](https://www.ebi.ac.uk/metagenomics/) pipeline raw-reads analyses, a well-established resource used for analyzing microbiome data.
Key components:
- Quality control and decontamination
- rRNA and ncRNA detection using Rfam database
- Taxonomic classification of SSU and LSU regions 
- Abundance analysis with mOTUs""" ;
