<https://workflowhub.eu/workflows/45?version=7> a ns1:ComputationalWorkflow,
        schema:SoftwareSourceCode ;
    dcterms:conformsTo <https://bioschemas.org/profiles/ComputationalWorkflow/1.0-RELEASE/> ;
    ns1:input <https://workflowhub.eu/workflows/45#ngtax-inputs-for_read_len>,
        <https://workflowhub.eu/workflows/45#ngtax-inputs-forward_primer>,
        <https://workflowhub.eu/workflows/45#ngtax-inputs-forward_reads>,
        <https://workflowhub.eu/workflows/45#ngtax-inputs-reference_db>,
        <https://workflowhub.eu/workflows/45#ngtax-inputs-rev_read_len>,
        <https://workflowhub.eu/workflows/45#ngtax-inputs-reverse_primer>,
        <https://workflowhub.eu/workflows/45#ngtax-inputs-reverse_reads>,
        <https://workflowhub.eu/workflows/45#ngtax-inputs-sample> ;
    ns1:output <https://workflowhub.eu/workflows/45#ngtax-outputs-files_to_folder_fastqc>,
        <https://workflowhub.eu/workflows/45#ngtax-outputs-files_to_folder_ngtax> ;
    schema:contributor <https://workflowhub.eu/people/46> ;
    schema:creativeWorkStatus "Stable" ;
    schema:creator <https://workflowhub.eu/people/46>,
        <https://workflowhub.eu/people/84>,
        <https://workflowhub.eu/workflows/45#>,
        <https://workflowhub.eu/workflows/45#Jesse%20van%20Dam>,
        <https://workflowhub.eu/workflows/45#Peter%20Schaap> ;
    schema:dateCreated "2020-10-28T11:07:26Z" ;
    schema:dateModified "2026-05-13T13:04:59Z" ;
    schema:description """Amplicon analysis workflow using NG-Tax

**Steps:**

* Quality control on the reads
* Execute NGTax for ASV detection and classification

For more information about NG-Tax 2.0 have a look at https://doi.org/10.3389/fgene.2019.01366""" ;
