    schema:dateModified "2026-05-13T13:04:51Z" ;
    schema:description "The workflow takes a paired-reads collection (like illumina WGS or HiC), runs FastQC and SeqKit, trims with Fastp, and creates a MultiQC report. The main outputs are a paired collection of trimmed reads, a report with raw and trimmed reads stats, and a table with raw reads stats." ;
