    schema:dateModified "2026-05-13T13:04:51Z" ;
    schema:description "The workflow takes a (trimmed) Long reads collection, runs Meryl to create a K-mer database, Genomescope2 to estimate genome properties and Smudgeplot to estimate ploidy (optional). The main results are K-mer database and genome profiling plots, tables, and values useful for downstream analysis. Default K-mer length and ploidy for Genomescope are 31 and 2, respectively. " ;
