    schema:description "The workflow takes a trimmed HiFi reads collection, Hap1/Hap2 contigs, and the values for transition parameter and max coverage depth (calculated from WF1) to run Purge_Dups. It produces purged Hap1 and Hap2 contigs assemblies, and runs all the QC analysis (gfastats, BUSCO, and Merqury)." ;
