    schema:description "Applies baredSC algorithm to fit and combine one-dimensional Gaussian mixture models (from 1 to N components) on log-normalized single-cell gene expression data. Enables identification of subpopulations based on expression of genes of interest and provides statistical assessment of the optimal number of components in heterogeneous cell populations." ;
