    schema:description "Generate phased assembly based on PacBio HiFi reads and parental Illumina data for phasing. Part of the VGP workflow suite, it needs to be run after the Trio k-mer Profiling workflow VGP2. This workflow uses HiFiasm for contigging, and generates assembly statistics, BUSCO reports, Merqury plots, and the genome assembly contigs in fasta and GFA format. " ;
