    schema:description """Workflow for NonSpliced RNAseq data with multiple aligners.

Steps:  
    - workflow_quality.cwl:
        - FastQC (control)
        - fastp (trimming)
    - bowtie2 (read mapping)
    - sam_to_sorted-bam
    - featurecounts (transcript read counts)
    - kallisto (transcript [pseudo]counts)
""" ;
