    schema:description """**Name:** K-Means GPU Cache OFF  
**Contact Person**: cristian.tatu@bsc.es  
**Access Level**: public  
**License Agreement**: Apache2  
**Platform**: COMPSs  
**Machine**: Minotauro-MN4  

K-Means running on GPUs.    
Launched using 32 GPUs (16 nodes). Parameters used: K=40 and 32 blocks of size (1_000_000, 1200).  
It creates a block for each GPU. Total dataset shape is (32_000_000, 1200).  
Version dislib-0.9

